  "title": "Honor Roll: Baugh, Montgomery and Lovett Collect SEC Weekly Awards After Ole Miss Rout",
  "excerpt": "Jadan Baugh, London Montgomery and Bryce Lovett each won their first SEC weekly honor after Florida's 52-28 win over No. 4 Ole Miss.",
